[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5942.31, "timestamp": "01:39:02", "text": "8,000時間稼げるから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5944.55, "timestamp": "01:39:04", "text": "ルピーは何らかの形で戻ってくるか何かですが、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5946.629, "timestamp": "01:39:06", "text": "私の人生のその6時間は二度と手に入らないだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5949.91, "timestamp": "01:39:09", "text": "戻る。だから私にとって時間はとても大切なのです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5952.07, "timestamp": "01:39:12", "text": "そして、私たちは回避できると思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5955.91, "timestamp": "01:39:15", "text": "周りを見渡すと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5957.83, "timestamp": "01:39:17", "text": "表面的なこととか色々あるけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5959.669, "timestamp": "01:39:19", "text": "私があなたと時間を過ごしているとき、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5961.35, "timestamp": "01:39:21", "text": "私は行きたい、私は行きたい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5963.83, "timestamp": "01:39:23", "text": "あなたが自分の魂がどんなものか知りたいと思っていることは分かっています。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5965.35, "timestamp": "01:39:25", "text": "ニクソンがなぜかはわからないが、これは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5968.55, "timestamp": "01:39:28", "text": "まるでポッドキャストみたいですよね？うん、そうだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5972.55, "timestamp": "01:39:32", "text": "このような。私はずっとこれをやりたかったんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5975.27, "timestamp": "01:39:35", "text": "まさにポッドキャストですね。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5976.168, "timestamp": "01:39:36", "author": "@OrangeSan", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1hzJ_11ALUfVaVrkxYo1ZVLPiK-9KSZ_F82omBSnvPLydlaR2DHr5h-PrrBJwHbm0GleoSyYuQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "To me memories are more important"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5978.95, "timestamp": "01:39:38", "text": "私はポッドキャストの共同ホストを務めています"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5979.689, "timestamp": "01:39:39", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Orange~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5982.149, "timestamp": "01:39:42", "text": "以前は、でも、そして、私は感じました、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5984.31, "timestamp": "01:39:44", "text": "改善しないといけないし、いろいろと。私は決して"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5986.326, "timestamp": "01:39:46", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "sup Orange"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5987.109, "timestamp": "01:39:47", "text": "どのような気持ちになるかは分かっていた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5990.629, "timestamp": "01:39:50", "text": "ここに客として滞在しています。それはとても良い"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5993.109, "timestamp": "01:39:53", "text": "本当の気持ち、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5996.39, "timestamp": "01:39:56", "text": "このような会話。うん、楽しんでるよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5998.79, "timestamp": "01:39:58", "text": "これ。楽しいですよ。"}]